1
00:00:00,659 --> 00:00:02,559
(Raj:)She is. She's just running a little late.

2
00:00:02,728 --> 00:00:07,498
(Raj:)You know how it is, girls, always fussing
about their hair, their makeup, she'll be here.

3
00:00:07,666 --> 00:00:09,096
(Raj:)Just give it a rest, okay?

4
00:00:11,904 --> 00:00:14,304
(Sheldon:)Can I have your attention, everyone?

5
00:00:16,909 --> 00:00:19,809
That's B-flat for those
who don't have perfect pitch.

6
00:00:21,614 --> 00:00:26,844
(Sheldon:)I would like to propose a toast
to my best friend, Dr. Leonard Hofstadter.

7
00:00:27,353 --> 00:00:30,483
(Sheldon:)He has been presented
with a wonderful opportunity...

8
00:00:30,656 --> 00:00:34,116
(Sheldon:)...and I couldn't be happier for him.

9
00:00:37,062 --> 00:00:39,822
(Leonard:)Thank you, Sheldon,
that must have been hard for you to say.

10
00:00:40,266 --> 00:00:43,426
(Sheldon:)Well, I mean it. I'm really happy for you.

11
00:00:44,536 --> 00:00:47,126
(Sheldon:)And that's how you get
a toothpaste commercial. Cheers.

12
00:00:48,741 --> 00:00:50,441
(Sheldon:)Cheers.

13
00:00:52,011 --> 00:00:55,711
That's really nice of you
to try to be happy for Leonard.

14
00:00:55,881 --> 00:01:03,021
(Leonard:)- Thank you.
- It must've killed you when I went to space.

